  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A block of mass m is released from rest and slides down a ramp of length d that makes an angle θ with the horizontal. A constant frictional force F acts on the block.</p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p><br/>What is the kinetic energy of the block at the bottom of the ramp?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">mgd − Fd cos θ</li><li data-label=\"B\">mgd − Fd</li><li data-label=\"C\">mgd sin θ − Fd cos θ</li><li data-label=\"D\">mgd sin θ − Fd</li></ol>"
  },
